{
  "project": "安城双尸案：144天，一台发动机",
  "voice_id": null,
  "language": "zh-CN",
  "voice_style": "悬疑低沉、成熟男声，沉稳克制不煽情",
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "text": "两个女人，连人带车，一夜之间凭空蒸发。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S01.mp3",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "text": "一百四十四天后，出卖凶手的，是一台发动机。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S02.mp3",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "text": "2007年3月1日傍晚，韩国安城，两个好姐妹正在厨房做饭。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S03.mp3",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "text": "她们离婚后同住多年，在赌场放高利贷，欠她们钱的人不少。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S04.mp3",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "text": "傍晚六点五十，她们说去见个熟人，饭菜还冒着热气。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S05.mp3",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "text": "这一走，人和那辆银色轿车，再也没有回来。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S06.mp3",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "text": "3月5日，同住的女人走进警察署：她们四天没回家了。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S07.mp3",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "text": "两部手机全部关机，银行账户一分钱没动。她们去了哪？",
      "file": "audio/voice/S08.mp3",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "text": "八千五百名警力翻遍金光水库和山林，一无所获。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S09.mp3",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "text": "女性接连失踪，满城恐慌，案子眼看成了悬案。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S10.mp3",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "text": "真相，藏在一笔赌债里。柳某的妻子沉迷赌博，欠下她们巨款。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S11.mp3",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "text": "两千五百万韩元，利滚利翻成五千万，催债一天比一天紧。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S12.mp3",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "text": "那天傍晚，他借口还钱，把两人约到思谷洞的山上。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S13.mp3",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "text": "天黑之后，山里只剩下铁锹挖土的声音。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S14.mp3",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "text": "当晚九点，他把那辆新车，交给了废车厂的几个后辈。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S15.mp3",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "text": "一辆崭新的伊兰特，被拆得只剩一堆零件。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S16.mp3",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "text": "发动机和零件装进集装箱，漂洋过海，运往中东。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S17.mp3",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "text": "他用死者手机发短信：暂时躲一躲警察。他以为，天衣无缝。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S18.mp3",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "text": "日历从三月翻到七月，线索一条接一条地断掉。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S19.mp3",
      "target_start": 110,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "text": "车不会凭空消失，刑警怀疑它被拆了，挨家去查废车厂。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S20.mp3",
      "target_start": 116,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "text": "一名工人低声说：有台发动机太新了，根本不像二手货。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S21.mp3",
      "target_start": 123,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "text": "而每台发动机，都有一串独一无二的编号。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S22.mp3",
      "target_start": 129,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "text": "顺着编号追查，这台发动机三月初就出口到了埃及。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S23.mp3",
      "target_start": 134,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "text": "埃及买家拍下编号发回韩国，和失踪那辆车，一模一样！",
      "file": "audio/voice/S24.mp3",
      "target_start": 141,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "text": "7月21日，拆车的四人落网；第二天，柳某被抓。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S25.mp3",
      "target_start": 148,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "text": "7月23日，在两米深的泥土下，警方找到了她们。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S26.mp3",
      "target_start": 154,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "text": "整整一百四十四天，她们一直在这座山里。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S27.mp3",
      "target_start": 160,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "text": "一对好姐妹，一起出了门，也一起没能回家。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S28.mp3",
      "target_start": 166,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "text": "一台太新的发动机，毁了完美犯罪。",
      "file": "audio/voice/S29.mp3",
      "target_start": 171,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "text": "哪个细节，最容易被凶手忽略？",
      "file": "audio/voice/S30.mp3",
      "target_start": 175,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    }
  ],
  "completed": 0
}
